1232:
An occupancy permit issued by the building inspector shall be required in advance of occupancy or use of each manufactured home
• Which is hereafter located to the City of Royston;
• Which is moved from one location to a second location within the city where that manufactured housing unit will house persons or property;
• Which has not been occupied within the preceding 12 months; or
• Where there is a change in use of the manufactured housing unit.
